  "vv4:0.4": "23. 4. Catutthapīṭhavimānavatthu ",
  "vv4:1.1": "‘‘Pīṭhaṃ te veḷuriyamayaṃ uḷāraṃ, ",
  "vv4:1.2": "manojavaṃ gacchati yenakāmaṃ; ",
  "vv4:1.3": "Alaṅkate malyadhare suvatthe, ",
  "vv4:1.4": "obhāsasi vijjurivabbhakūṭaṃ. ",
  "vv4:2.1": "24. ‘‘Kena tetādiso vaṇṇo, ",
  "vv4:2.2": "kena te idha mijjhati; ",
  "vv4:2.3": "Uppajjanti ca te bhogā, ",
  "vv4:2.4": "ye keci manaso piyā. ",
  "vv4:3.1": "25. ‘‘Pucchāmi taṃ devi mahānubhāve, ",
  "vv4:3.2": "manussabhūtā kimakāsi puññaṃ; ",
  "vv4:3.3": "Kenāsi evaṃ jalitānubhāvā, ",
  "vv4:3.4": "vaṇṇo ca te sabbadisā pabhāsatī’’ti. ",
  "vv4:4.1": "26. Sā devatā attamanā, ",
  "vv4:4.2": "moggallānena pucchitā; ",
  "vv4:4.3": "Pañhaṃ puṭṭhā viyākāsi, ",
  "vv4:4.4": "yassa kammassidaṃ phalaṃ. ",
  "vv4:5.1": "27. ‘‘Appassa kammassa phalaṃ mamedaṃ, ",
  "vv4:5.2": "yenamhi evaṃ jalitānubhāvā; ",
  "vv4:5.3": "Ahaṃ manussesu manussabhūtā, ",
  "vv4:5.4": "purimāya jātiyā manussaloke. ",
  "vv4:6.1": "28. ‘‘Addasaṃ virajaṃ bhikkhuṃ, ",
  "vv4:6.2": "vippasannamanāvilaṃ; ",
  "vv4:6.3": "Tassa adāsahaṃ pīṭhaṃ, ",
  "vv4:6.4": "pasannā sehi pāṇibhi. ",
  "vv4:7.1": "29. ‘‘Tena metādiso vaṇṇo, ",
  "vv4:7.2": "tena me idha mijjhati; ",
  "vv4:7.3": "Uppajjanti ca me bhogā, ",
  "vv4:7.4": "ye keci manaso piyā. ",
  "vv4:8.1": "30. ‘‘Akkhāmi te bhikkhu mahānubhāva, ",
  "vv4:8.2": "manussabhūtā yamakāsi puññaṃ; ",
  "vv4:8.3": "Tenamhi evaṃ jalitānubhāvā, ",
  "vv4:8.4": "vaṇṇo ca me sabbadisā pabhāsatī’’ti. ",
  "vv4:9.1": "Catutthapīṭhavimānaṃ catutthaṃ. "
}
